# Internal engineering docs. They stay in the working tree at the same paths;
# they are simply not published. The repo publishes what GPL-3.0 asks for:
# the source, the build and install scripts, LICENSE, both READMEs and the
# archived release notes.
#
# `Docs/*.md` is a PATTERN, not a list of filenames — a missed ignore cannot be
# taken back once pushed, an extra one costs nothing. To publish a doc, add an
# explicit `!` whitelist line below. The pattern matches only the top level of
# Docs/, so Docs/Archive/Releases/ is unaffected.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.codex/
Docs/*.md
Docs/Archive/Diagnostics/
Docs/Archive/Engineering/
Docs/Archive/Planning/
Docs/Archive/Samples/
Docs/Plans/

# Local-only demo helper; not part of the app.
Scripts/demo_mode.sh
